<!DOCTYPE html>
<%# The printable manuscript is a document, not a workspace page: it has no
    navbar, sidebar, or action bar, which is what makes the printed page the
    manuscript and nothing else. It is pinned to the light theme on purpose —
    the reader's dark preference is a screen setting, and a dark page would
    print as a page of ink. The app stylesheet supplies the same typography as
    the rest of the product; `manuscript.css` adds only this document's page. %>
<html lang="<%= AppLocale.html_lang_for(current_locale) %>" data-bs-theme="light">
  <head>
    <title><%= content_for(:title) || t("app.name") %></title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <%= csp_meta_tag %>

    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.png" type="image/png">
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag :app, "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
  </head>

  <body class="manuscript-body">
    <%= yield %>
  </body>
</html>
